          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Height of the source above (positive) or below (negative) the world plane, in world units. Default 0. Independent of Spatializable.position, and preserved across a position change that does not carry a z. It contributes to distance attenuation, to the panner's own directionality, and to Doppler - a source rising straight up recedes."
        },
